(It is also important to note that no samples processed in Suite 116 for the week of testing \(03-May-2026 to 09-May-2026\) failed testing.) Tj
0 -8.928 Td
0 -8.928 Td
0 -8.928 Td
0 -8.928 Td
/Helv 8 Tf
(Based on the available investigation findings, no specific analyst-related, procedural, equipment-related, or other laboratory-related cause ) Tj
0 -8.928 Td
/Helv 8 Tf
(was identified. The excursion appears to have been transient and non-recurring, and no assignable root cause was established. It is to be ) Tj
0 -8.928 Td
/Helv 8 Tf
(noted that the growth observed on the weekly active air and weekly surface sampling plates for the day of testing did not follow a trend, ) Tj
0 -8.928 Td
/Helv 8 Tf
(indicating that the contamination was transient in nature and that routine daily disinfection procedures were effective in eliminating the ) Tj
0 -8.928 Td
/Helv 8 Tf
(contamination. Furthermore, no trend was observed in the clean room's previous weekly EM data, therefore, no preventive and corrective ) Tj
0 -8.928 Td
/Helv 8 Tf
(actions are deemed necessary at this time.) Tj
ET
